### Series Solution Recap

The series solution for the potential \( u(x, y) \) is:
\[ u(x, y) = \sum_{n=1,3,5,\ldots} \left( 50 \cos\left(\frac{n\pi x}{3}\right) - 50 \cot\left(\frac{n\pi}{3}\right) \sin\left(\frac{n\pi x}{3}\right) \right) \frac{200}{n\pi} \sin\left(\frac{n\pi y}{3}\right) \]

### MATLAB Script

