Transitioning from a 1D to a 2D scenario for validating a PDE model involves extending the spatial dimensions and adapting the numerical methods accordingly. Here are the steps and considerations for validating a 2D PDE model, specifically for the heat equation \( u_t = k (u_{xx} + u_{yy}) \):

### Steps to Validate a 2D PDE Model

